{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":1,"id":"type-alias-tableoptionstfeatures-tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Alias: TableOptions<TFeatures, TData>"}]},{"type":"code","value":"type TableOptions<TFeatures, TData> = TableOptions_Core<TFeatures, TData> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TableOptions_FeatureMap<TFeatures, TData>> & DebugOptions<TFeatures>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableOptions.ts#L131","children":[{"type":"text","value":"types/TableOptions.ts:131"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Complete table options for a specific feature set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Feature options are included only when their feature is present in\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":", then custom feature/plugin options and debug options are mixed\nin."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tfeatures","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TFeatures"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TFeatures"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/TableFeatures.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TableFeatures"}]}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdata","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TData"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"link","href":"RowData.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"RowData"}]}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-alias-tableoptionstfeatures-tdata","text":"Type Alias: TableOptions<TFeatures, TData>","level":1},{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tfeatures","text":"TFeatures","level":3},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n# Type Alias: TableOptions\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype TableOptions<TFeatures, TData> = TableOptions_Core<TFeatures, TData> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TableOptions_FeatureMap<TFeatures, TData>> & DebugOptions<TFeatures>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableOptions.ts:131](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableOptions.ts#L131)\n\nComplete table options for a specific feature set.\n\nFeature options are included only when their feature is present in\n`TFeatures`, then custom feature/plugin options and debug options are mixed\nin.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](RowData.md)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: TableOptions\ntitle: TableOptions\n---\n\n# Type Alias: TableOptions\\<TFeatures, TData\\>\n\n```ts\ntype TableOptions<TFeatures, TData> = TableOptions_Core<TFeatures, TData> & ExtractFeatureMapTypes<TFeatures, TableOptions_FeatureMap<TFeatures, TData>> & DebugOptions<TFeatures>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [types/TableOptions.ts:131](https://github.com/TanStack/table/blob/main/packages/table-core/src/types/TableOptions.ts#L131)\n\nComplete table options for a specific feature set.\n\nFeature options are included only when their feature is present in\n`TFeatures`, then custom feature/plugin options and debug options are mixed\nin.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TFeatures\n\n`TFeatures` *extends* [`TableFeatures`](../interfaces/TableFeatures.md)\n\n### TData\n\n`TData` *extends* [`RowData`](RowData.md)\n"}
